  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c52916ce72f179dd",
      "translationZh": "终于在我的 M4Pro 48GB Mac 上跑起来了 3.8-Flash-Next，用的是 https://huggingface.co/ISTA-DASLab/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-GSQ-RCO-GGUF",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5539b4409ae862f5",
      "translationZh": "稠密模型 3.8-27B 就是更快……而且可能因为量化级别的缘故，效果也更好……",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b3b10f9e86a296ff",
      "translationZh": "等一下，在 llama.cpp 中设置了一些关键参数后，Flash-Next 实际上跑得比 27B 更快。它能撑到 131K 而不发生内存不足……也许吧……",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bc621c7628fcb827",
      "translationZh": "0.36.940.283 I srv 负载: 20",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ab82a71884bb5b29",
      "translationZh": "0.36.940.284 I srv 负载：--cache-type-k",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "29fdf5d951528ecf",
      "translationZh": "是的，这个模型猛得离谱。这个在 llama.cpp 中采用 Q2_0 的量化版本，在提示词处理、生成速度方面都胜过了采用 oQ4e 的 27B，但最重要的是，它在唯一真正重要的方面——纯粹的智能水平——也更胜一筹。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e94f59447c74b21",
      "translationZh": "拥有 48 GB 内存，真是赶上了好时候！！！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df92f0f3c00b3981",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/JLeonsarmiento 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
